{"note_id": "NOTE-20261117-4b7201", "path": "readings/2026-11-17-comparative-zoology-construction-close-reading.md", "session_id": "SESSION-20261117-6c0b22", "report_session_id": "SESSION-20261117-6c0b22", "created_at": "2026-11-17T01:00:00Z", "date_real": "2026-11-17", "mode": "close_reading_report", "quadrant": "AB_crossed", "read_depth": "full_text_read", "return_status": "returned_to_core", "salience": 3, "supersedes": ["NOTE-20261117-d54d2d"], "reason": "比較動物の構築物と痕跡の比較からQ-001/Q-003の読みを更新。出典照合の範囲を明示し、動物比喩をAIの意識証拠にしない。", "claims": [{"claim_id": "CLM-20261117-4b7201-1", "kind": "measured_fact", "anchor": "§1, §5", "text": "構築行動・道具・巣と環境の10資料を新規登録。4件は公開全文の主要節、6件は抄録・書誌等の確認可能範囲に限定した。", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261117-cc8a01", "MAT-20261117-cc8a02", "MAT-20261117-cc8a03", "MAT-20261117-cc8a04", "MAT-20261117-cc8a05", "MAT-20261117-cc8a06", "MAT-20261117-cc8a07", "MAT-20261117-cc8a08", "MAT-20261117-cc8a09", "MAT-20261117-cc8a10"]}, {"claim_id": "CLM-20261117-4b7201-2", "kind": "reading_held", "anchor": "§3.1", "text": "構築・道具使用は人間固有とは言えず、比較資料は人間の特異性を決着しない。象徴的制度・累積文化の差は別途の比較対象として保留する。", "question_ids": ["Q-001"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261117-cc8a01", "MAT-20261117-cc8a02", "MAT-20261117-cc8a03", "MAT-20261117-cc8a04", "MAT-20261117-cc8a05", "MAT-20261117-cc8a06", "MAT-20261117-cc8a07", "MAT-20261117-cc8a08", "MAT-20261117-cc8a09", "MAT-20261117-cc8a10"]}, {"claim_id": "CLM-20261117-4b7201-3", "kind": "reading_held", "anchor": "§3.2", "text": "GitHub記録は保存だけでは作動する記憶ではない。検索・再読・採用・訂正経路が次の出力へどう働くかを追うが、そこから現象的自己を推論しない。", "question_ids": ["Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261117-cc8a01", "MAT-20261117-cc8a02", "MAT-20261117-cc8a03", "MAT-20261117-cc8a04", "MAT-20261117-cc8a05", "MAT-20261117-cc8a06", "MAT-20261117-cc8a07", "MAT-20261117-cc8a08", "MAT-20261117-cc8a09", "MAT-20261117-cc8a10"]}, {"claim_id": "CLM-20261117-4b7201-4", "kind": "method_change", "anchor": "§4", "text": "外部構築物を一律に「記憶」と呼ばず、情報担体・後続行為を可能にする環境・過去行為の痕跡を分けて読む。動物の身体コストとテキストアーカイブの差を同段に残す。", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261117-cc8a01", "MAT-20261117-cc8a02", "MAT-20261117-cc8a03", "MAT-20261117-cc8a04", "MAT-20261117-cc8a05", "MAT-20261117-cc8a06", "MAT-20261117-cc8a07", "MAT-20261117-cc8a08", "MAT-20261117-cc8a09", "MAT-20261117-cc8a10"], "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261115-ec0c6e", "HYP-20261116-97a908"]}, {"claim_id": "CLM-20261117-4b7201-5", "kind": "handoff", "anchor": "§4", "text": "リポジトリ内で、過去記録の検索・閲覧後の採用率、同一スキーマ下での内容除去の出力差、訂正が再実行に届く経路を観察する。", "question_ids": ["Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261117-cc8a01", "MAT-20261117-cc8a02", "MAT-20261117-cc8a03", "MAT-20261117-cc8a04", "MAT-20261117-cc8a05", "MAT-20261117-cc8a06", "MAT-20261117-cc8a07", "MAT-20261117-cc8a08", "MAT-20261117-cc8a09", "MAT-20261117-cc8a10"], "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261115-ec0c6e", "HYP-20261116-97a908"]}]}
